# Agreement on PNR data processing and transfer

This scope computes the date the agreement enters into force and the date of termination based on notice.

```catala
declaration scope AgreementScope:
  input signature_date content date
  input notification_date content date
  input notice_period content duration
  output termination_date content date
```

## Termination Date

The termination takes effect ninety days from the date of notification of termination.

```catala
scope AgreementScope:
  date round down
  definition termination_date equals
    notification_date + 90 day
```